<Document>
  <name>EpicBreezy Segment 5 - Yakima WA to Oceanside CA</name>
  <description>Flown 4-7 September 2026, four flying days, 13 airports. Track from GoPro wing-camera GPMF telemetry (left + right LRV proxies). Leg 02 carries an overlay from the Garmin on the aircraft: the right camera was the only one running on that leg and its GPS froze for 142 s mid-flight. The Garmin also catches the departure from Hood River, five minutes before the camera started.</description>
